nvcc with a GCC 16 host compiler and __builtin_structured_binding_size.

GCC 16 provides __builtin_structured_binding_size, and nvcc (13.4) reports it
through __has_builtin as well, but its front end can't parse the builtin's type
argument: every CUDA translation unit including stdexec fails with "type name
is not allowed" and "identifier __builtin_structured_binding_size is
undefined". Under nvcc stdexec uses its library fallback instead.

